ed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.\u003C/licence>\n                \u003C/availability>\n            \u003C/publicationStmt>\n            \u003CsourceDesc>\n                \u003CmsDesc>\n                    \u003CmsIdentifier>\n                        \u003Ccountry>Italy\u003C/country>\n                        \u003Cregion>Sicily\u003C/region>\n                        \u003Csettlement>Halaesa\u003C/settlement>\n                        \u003Crepository role=\"museum\" ref=\"http://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/museum/053\">Antiquarium e sito archeologico di Halaesa\u003C/repository>\n                        \u003C!--No inventory number found-->\n                        \u003C!--Adding location for old id numbers if available-->\n                        \u003CaltIdentifier>\n                            \u003Csettlement/>\n                            \u003Crepository/>\n                            \u003Cidno type=\"old\"/>\n                        \u003C/altIdentifier>\n                    \u003C/msIdentifier>\n                    \u003CmsContents>\n                        \u003CtextLang mainLang=\"la\">Latin\u003C/textLang>\n                    \u003C/msContents>\n                    \u003CphysDesc>\n                        \u003CobjectDesc>\n                            \u003CsupportDesc>\n                                \u003Csupport>\u003Cp>Four fragments of stucco plaster bearing traces of an incised inscription on which traces of red paint remain; the fragments are associated with other stucco fragments all of which are in turn associated with architrave elements of the so-called 'contraforte' or 'basamento curvilineo' above what is now know to be the cavea of the theatre.\u003C/p>\n                                    \u003Cmaterial ana=\"#material.inorganic.mortars\" type=\"mortars\" subtype=\"unverified\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/material/lod/126.html\">plaster\u003C/material>\n                                    \u003CobjectType ana=\"#object.arch_element.architrave\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/objtyp/lod/119.html\">architrave\u003C/objectType>\n                                    \u003Cdimensions>\n                                        \u003Cheight unit=\"cm\"/>\n                                        \u003Cwidth unit=\"cm\"/>\n                                        \u003Cdepth unit=\"cm\"/>\n                                    \u003C/dimensions>\n                                \u003C/support>\n                                \u003Ccondition ana=\"#condition.fragments.non-contiguous\"/>\n\t\t    \u003C/supportDesc>\n                            \u003ClayoutDesc>\n                                \u003Clayout>\u003Cp>traces of a single line of letters, incised and painted.\u003C/p>\n                                    \u003Crs ana=\"#execution.chiselled\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1\">chiselled\u003C/rs>\n                                    \u003Crs ana=\"#execution.rubrication.red\">Rubrication, red coloured\u003C/rs>\n                                \t\u003Cdamage/>\n\t\t\t\u003C/layout>\n                            \u003C/layoutDesc>\n                        \u003C/objectDesc>\n                        \u003ChandDesc>\n                            \u003ChandNote>\u003Cp>'Caratteri di forma allungata e sottile' (Carettoni).\u003C/p>\n                                \u003Clocus from=\"line1\" to=\"line1\">Line 1\u003C/locus>\n                                \u003Cdimensions type=\"letterHeight\">\n                                    \u003Cheight unit=\"mm\"/>\n                                \u003C/dimensions>\n                                \u003Clocus from=\"line1\" to=\"line2\">Interlineation line 1 to 2\u003C/locus>\n                                \u003Cdimensions type=\"interlinear\">\n                                    \u003Cheight unit=\"mm\"/>\n                                \u003C/dimensions>\n                            \u003C/handNote>\n                        \u003C/handDesc>\n                    \u003C/physDesc>\n                    \u003Chistory>\n                        \u003Corigin>\n                            \u003CorigPlace>\u003Cregion>Sicilia\u003C/region>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"ancient\" ref=\"http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462225\">Halaesa\u003C/placeName>\t\t\n                                \u003Coffset>near\n                                    \u003CplaceName type=\"modern\" ref=\"http://sws.geonames.org/2525099\">Castel di Tusa\u003C/placeName>\n                                \u003C/offset>\n                            \t\u003Cgeo>37.99907, 14.26197\u003C/geo>\n\t\t\u003C/origPlace>\n                            \u003CorigDate datingMethod=\"#julian\" notBefore-custom=\"-0200\" notAfter-custom=\"0100\">2nd century BCE — 1st century CE (?)\u003C/origDate>\n                        \u003C/origin>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"found\" subtype=\"discovered\" when=\"1952-06\">Found in 1952 in front of the 'avancorpo centrale' of the 'basamento curvilineo' ('Rinvenuti in corrispondenza dell'avancorpo centrale, nello sterro superficiale ed al piano di risega (giorn. scavo, 20-30 giugno 1952)')\u003Cgeo>37.999278, 14.262245\u003C/geo>\u003C/provenance>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"not-observed\">Not yet located in store\u003C/provenance>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"observed\" subtype=\"autopsied\">None\u003C/provenance>\n                        \u003Cacquisition/>\n                    \u003C/history>\n                \u003C/msDesc>\n            \u003C/sourceDesc>\n        \u003C/fileDesc>\n        \u003CencodingDesc>\n             \u003Cp>Encoded following the latest EpiDoc guidelines\u003C/p>\n             \u003Cxi:include href=\"../alists/ISicily-taxonomies.xml\">\n                 \u003Cxi:fallback>\n                     \u003Cp>Taxonomies for ISicily controlled values\u003C/p>\n                 \u003C/xi:fallback>\n             \u003C/xi:include>\n\t  \u003Cxi:include href=\"../alists/charDecl.xml\">\n\t     \u003Cxi:fallback>\n\t       \u003Cp>ISicily glyphs authority list\u003C/p>\n\t     \u003C/xi:fallback>\n\t   \u003C/xi:include>\n         \u003C/encodingDesc>\n        \u003CprofileDesc>\n            \u003CcalendarDesc>\n                \u003Ccalendar xml:id=\"julian\">\n                    \u003Cp>Julian Calendar\u003C/p>\n                \u003C/calendar>\n            \u003C/calendarDesc>\n            \u003ClangUsage>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"en\">English\u003C/language> \n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"it\">Italian\u003C/language> \n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"grc\">Ancient Greek\u003C/language> \n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"la\">Latin\u003C/language> \n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"he\">Hebrew\u003C/language> \n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"phn\">Phoenician\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"xpu\">Punic\u003C/language>\n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"osc\">Oscan\u003C/language> \n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"xly\">Elymian\u003C/language> \n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"scx\">Sikel\u003C/language>  \n                \u003Clanguage ident=\"sxc\">Sikan\u003C/language>  \n            \u003C/langUsage>\n            \u003CtextClass>\n                \u003Ckeywords scheme=\"https://ontology.inscriptiones.org/type_of_inscription\">\n                    \u003Cterm ana=\"#function.building\" ref=\"https://ontology.inscriptiones.org/type_of_inscription/Building_inscription\" cert=\"low\">building\u003C/term>\n                \u003C/keywords>\n            \u003C/textClass>\n        \u003C/profileDesc>\n        \u003CrevisionDesc status=\"draft\">\n            \u003ClistChange>\n                \u003Cchange when=\"2016-12-03\" who=\"#JCu\">James Cummings autogenerated EpiDoc output from database\u003C/change>\n            \t   \u003Cchange when=\"2020-10-05\" who=\"#SS\">Simona Stoyanova normalised Unicode\u003C/change>\n            \t   \u003Cchange when=\"2020-10-08\" who=\"#SS\">Simona Stoyanova updated list of languages\u003C/change>\n            \t\u003Cchange when=\"2020-11-26\" who=\"#SS\">Simona Stoyanova restructured bibliography\u003C/change>\n\t    \u003Cchange when=\"2020-12-23\" who=\"#JP\">Updated Zenodo DOI\u003C/change>\n            \t\u003Cchange when=\"2021-01-19\" who=\"#SS\">renumbered files, uris and references\u003C/change>\n                \u003Cchange when=\"2021-11-22\" who=\"#JP\">Jonathan Prag revised file from publication\u003C/change>\n\t\u003C/listChange>\n        \u003C/revisionDesc>\n    \u003C/teiHeader>\n    \u003Cfacsimile>\u003Csurface/>\u003C!--\n        \u003Csurface type=\"front\">\n            \u003Cgraphic n=\"screen\" url=\"ISic003680_tiled.tif\" height=\"3680px\" width=\"5520px\">\n                \u003Cdesc>I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n            \u003Cgraphic n=\"print\" url=\"ISic003680.jpg\" height=\"3680px\" width=\"5520px\">\n                \u003Cdesc>I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\u003C/desc>\n            \u003C/graphic>\n         \u003C/surface>\n     -->\u003C/facsimile>\n    \u003Ctext>\n        \u003Cbody>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"edition\" subtype=\"primary\" xml:space=\"preserve\" xml:lang=\"la\" resp=\"#JP\">\n                \u003Cdiv type=\"textpart\" subtype=\"fragment-physical\" n=\"a\">\n                    \u003Cab>\n                        \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Corig>VIM\u003C/orig>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\n                    \u003C/ab>\n                \u003C/div>\n                \u003Cdiv type=\"textpart\" subtype=\"fragment-physical\" n=\"b\">\n                    \u003Cab>\n                        \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Corig>M\u003C/orig>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\n                    \u003C/ab>\n                \u003C/div>\n                \u003Cdiv type=\"textpart\" subtype=\"fragment-physical\" n=\"c\">\n                    \u003Cab>\n                        \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"illegible\" unit=\"character\" extent=\"unknown\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\n                    \u003C/ab>\n                \u003C/div>\n                \u003Cdiv type=\"textpart\" subtype=\"fragment-physical\" n=\"d\">\n                    \u003Cab>\n                        \u003Clb n=\"1\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"illegible\" unit=\"character\" extent=\"unknown\"/>\u003Cgap reason=\"lost\" extent=\"unknown\" unit=\"character\"/>\n                    \u003C/ab>\n                \u003C/div>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"apparatus\" resp=\"#JP\">\n                \u003ClistApp>\n                    \u003Capp>\u003Cnote>Text as reported by Carettoni\u003C/note>\u003C/app>\n                \u003C/listApp>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"translation\">\n                \u003Cp>\u003C!--translation(s) - add @xml:lang for 'en' or 'it' to div-->\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"commentary\">\n                \u003Cp>Without further information, such as the dimensions of the letters, it is impossible to know whether these fragments relate to e.g. a building inscription or a more ephemeral text, but the fact that they are described as both incised and painted, encourages a view that they are more formal, while the brief description of form perhaps suggests a later rather than earlier date.\u003C/p>\n            \u003C/div>\n            \u003Cdiv type=\"bibliography\">\n                \u003ClistBibl type=\"edition\">\n                    \u003Cbibl type=\"bulletin\" n=\"NSA\">\n                        \u003Cauthor>Carettoni\u003C/author>\n                        \u003Ctitle>NSA\u003C/title>\n                        \u003Cdate>1959\u003C/date>\n                        \u003CcitedRange>332 no. g\u003C/citedRange>\n                        \u003Cptr target=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/382445/items/4MCP2PVV\"/>\n                    \u003Cref target=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001392\u003C/ref>\u003C/bibl>\n                \u003C/listBibl>\n\t   \u003ClistBibl type=\"discussion\">\u003Cbibl/>\u003C/listBibl>\n            \u003C/div>\n        \u003C/body>\n    \u003C/text>\n\u003C/TEI>\n"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
